==Miscellaneous==
*Improved [[Enemy Guide]]:
**Now shows the enemies' traits and [[Special Abilities]] in the upper-right corner of the screen, just like in the [[Cat Guide]].
**Enemies' types are no longer shown next to their names, including the joke "Cool Dude" type listed next to [[Cat God]]'s and [[Final Boss Giga-God]]'s names.
**Most [[:Category:Event Enemies|Event Enemies]] are now included but do not have descriptions. This gives official names to some enemies that were previously unnamed, such as [[Li'l Cake Doge]] and [[Chocolate Doge]].
**Most [[:Category:Collaboration Event Enemies|Collaboration Event Enemies]] are also listed, but only during their respective collabs. Exceptions include [[Mega Cat (Enemy)|Mega Cat]], [[Mega Cat EX (Enemy)|Mega Cat EX]], [[White Wind]], [[Red Wind]] and [[Dark Wind]], all of which have permanent Enemy Guide entries and can all be found in non-collab stages save for Mega Cat EX.
**[[Enemy Bases]] are still omitted, as are the [[Birthday Cake|Birthday Cakes]], [[W (form 1)]], [[W (form 2)]], [[W (form 3)]], [[Package Doge]], [[Rat Doge]], [[Cow Doge]], [[Tiger Doge]] and [[Rabbit Doge]].
*Jumping to the Enemy Guide by clicking on enemy icons in the "Enemies Appearing" window after tapping a stage name only shows the enemies appearing in the stage, rather than the entire Enemy Guide.
*Quitting a stage after 10 or more seconds will allow the player to see all enemies appearing by tapping on the stage's name. Previously, this could only be done after winning or losing the stage.
*[[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] is now listed before [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] in all menus.
*Added 1 new Special Ability: [[Metal Killer]].
**Allows units to deal a percentage of [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal Enemies]]' current HP as damage.
*Implemented Relic [[Talent Orbs]].
*Added a new stage mechanic, unofficially dubbed "[[Base Barrier]]":
**Prevents the enemy base from being damaged until the boss is defeated, at which point the Base Barrier automatically shatters. In stages where the boss only spawns when the enemy base is damaged, the Base Barrier won't appear until the boss spawns.
**Uses sprites for a green [[Barrier]] that were added to the game's files in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]].
**Appears in all stages of [[Anniversary/11 1/2 Year#Disaster in the Wan Wan Kingdom|Disaster in the Wan Wan Kingdom]].
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**22,200 grants +3 Gold Z.
**22,300 grants +3 Meteorite Z.
**22,400 grants +3 Beast Bones Z.

